  "description": "The strongest fighter at the worst high school in the country, Dupaul High School: Ryu U-Jin. He never loses a fight, but in reality, he's a romance novel maniac and an aspiring webtoon artist. Determined to find true romance, Ryu U-Jin decides to transfer to an ordinary co-ed school. Will he be able to find sweet romance material at his new school and create a proper work?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
